## API reference

### ProductCard

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `name:` / `description:` | `String` | - | Title and subtitle. |
| `price:` / `original_price:` | `Numeric` | - | Current and struck-through price. |
| `currency:` | `String` | `"USD"` | Currency of both prices. |
| `image:` / `image_alt:` | `String` | - | Photo URL and its description; a placeholder without one. |
| `badge:` | `String` | the discount | Text of the corner badge. |
| `wishlist:` / `wishlisted:` | `Boolean` | `true` / `false` | Show the heart toggle; start it pressed. |
| `action:` / `method:` | `String` / `Symbol` | - / `:post` | Make the card a form posting there. |
| `product_id:` | any | - | Submitted as a hidden `product_id`. |

### ProductOptions

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `sizes:` / `selected:` | `Array` / `String` | `[]` / - | Size choices (submitted as `size`). |
| `quantity:` / `max:` | `Integer` | `1` / `9` | Starting and maximum quantity (submitted as `quantity`). |
| `compact:` | `Integer` | `3` | Sizes shown on small screens. |

### ProductAddToCart

`label:` replaces "Add to cart"; other attributes go to the Button.
